{"4474870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Puss in Box", "steam_appid": 4474870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puss In Box</strong> is a cozy cat search simulator with puzzle and pet care elements. Your room is filled with cute, recognizable purrs, and your task is to outsmart them all. Explore a cozy room filled with interactive objects. These furry rascals are clever at hiding: behind curtains, in closets, and even under furniture, and some won't agree to sleep in a box until you feed them their favorite treat, which you'll also need to find first. Play at your own pace, enjoying the pleasant graphics and relaxing soundtrack.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the room, peeking into every corner and interactive object to collect all the furry rascals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort the cats you find into boxes, but remember: some need to be paired, while others won't be happy;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing gameplay, pleasant graphics, and a purring soundtrack will give you moments of zen after a hard day.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puss In Box</strong> is a cozy cat search simulator with puzzle and pet care elements. Your room is filled with cute, recognizable purrs, and your task is to outsmart them all. Explore a cozy room filled with interactive objects. These furry rascals are clever at hiding: behind curtains, in closets, and even under furniture, and some won't agree to sleep in a box until you feed them their favorite treat, which you'll also need to find first. Play at your own pace, enjoying the pleasant graphics and relaxing soundtrack.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the room, peeking into every corner and interactive object to collect all the furry rascals;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort the cats you find into boxes, but remem